{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-05T07:41:01+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-05T07:41:01+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Alphabet Inc.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Internet Content & Information","country":"United States","city":"Mountain View","website":"https://abc.xyz","employees":204757,"summary":"Alphabet Inc. offers various products and platforms in the United States, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia-Pacific, Canada, and Latin America. It operates through Google Services, Google Cloud, and Other Bets segments. The Google Services segment provides products and services, including ads, Android, Chrome, devices, Gmail, Google Drive, Google Maps, Google Photos, Google Play, Search, and YouTube. It is also involved in the sale of apps and in-app purchases and digital content in Google Play and YouTube; and devices, as well as the provision of YouTube consumer subscription services, such as YouTube TV, YouTube Music and Premium, NFL Sunday Ticket, and Google One. The Google Cloud segment offers consumption-based fees and subscriptions for AI solutions, including AI infrastructure, Vertex AI platform, and Gemini enterprise. It also provides cybersecurity, and data and analytics services; Google Workspace that include cloud-based communication and collaboration tools for enterprises, such as Calendar, Gmail, Docs, Drive, and Meet; and other enterprise services. The Other Bets segment sells transportation and internet services. Alphabet Inc. was incorporated in 1998 and is headquartered in Mountain View, California.","exchange":"NasdaqGS","currency":"USD","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"Alphabet Inc. offre divers produits et plateformes aux États-Unis, en Europe, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique, en Asie-Pacifique, au Canada et en Amérique latine. Il opère via les segments Google Services, Google Cloud et Autres paris. Le segment Google Services fournit des produits et services, notamment des annonces, Android, Chrome, des appareils, Gmail, Google Drive, Google Maps, Google Photos, Google Play, Search et YouTube. Il est également impliqué dans la vente d'applications et d'achats in-app et de contenu numérique dans Google Play et YouTube; et les appareils, ainsi que la fourniture de services d'abonnement aux consommateurs YouTube, tels que YouTube TV, YouTube Music et Premium, NFL Sunday Ticket et Google One. Le segment Google Cloud propose des frais et des abonnements basés sur la consommation pour les solutions d'IA, notamment l'infrastructure d'IA, la plate-forme d'IA Vertex et l'entreprise Gemini. Il fournit également des services de cybersécurité, de données et d'analyse; Google Workspace qui comprend des outils de communication et de collaboration basés sur le cloud pour les entreprises, tels que Calendar, Gmail, Docs, Drive et Meet; et d'autres services d'entreprise. Le segment Autres paris vend des services de transport et Internet. Alphabet Inc. a été constituée en 1998 et a son siège social à Mountain View, en Californie."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":3552105201664,"shares_outstanding":5888000000,"trailing_pe":15.0877285,"forward_pe":18.64862,"price_to_book":5.385863,"ev_to_ebitda":18.626,"ev_to_revenue":7.335,"dividend_yield":0.003,"payout_ratio":0.044899996,"beta_yahoo":1.226},"targets":{"current_price":288.93,"mean":400.37357,"median":400.0,"high":500.0,"low":300.0,"n_analysts":53,"reco_mean":1.34483,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-28"],"eps_avg":3.26702,"eps_low":2.89611,"eps_high":3.72,"revenue_avg":142401246490,"ex_dividend":"2026-09-04","dividend_date":"2026-12-14"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.01592,"institutions_pct":0.80667,"institutions_float_pct":0.81972003,"institutions_n":7462,"institutions":[{"name":"Blackrock Inc.","pct":0.0783,"shares":460972803,"value":133188868594,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0313},{"name":"Vanguard Capital Managemen